      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "passive",
        "description": "<p>The trial takes place in a pocket dimension that exists beyond the influence of the other realms. While here, PCs can't use their features and abilities. Each player must put their Domain cards in their vault.</p><section id=\"secret-ImJWy36uInJMMu1x\" class=\"secret\"><p>What besides the courtroom resides in this pocket dimension? What powers maintain the universal barrier protecting this place?</p></section>",
