      },
      "_key": "!actors.items!QbGEzb5Gvq36qYDj.X91s1yNbX9BFGthV"
    },
    {
      "name": "\"Order in the Court!\"",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "reaction",
        "description": "<p>When the PCs attempt to escape or end the trial through force, summon a number of Temporal Enforcers equal to the number of PCs in the scene within Close range and immediately spotlight one.</p><section id=\"secret-dy2SSipjq5tsKais\" class=\"secret\"><p>Is this court's authority worthy of respect? What besides the might of the Time Council and its enforcers justifies their control over the timeline?</p></section>",
        "attribution": {},
        "gmNotes": "",
